title: "presidio-evidence: a signed-evidence substrate with canonical JSON, Ed25519 and HMAC evidence references and fail-closed verification"
abstract: >-
  Signed-evidence substrate: canonical JSON, content addressing, Ed25519 and
  HMAC evidence references, provenance parents and fail-closed verification,
  specified by JSON schemas and golden vectors with Python and Rust
  conformance.
